8/2000

Several modifications to the base Togl-1.6 distribution have been made to 
adapt it for purposes here:

- autoconf/automake infrastructure added

- Internal headers for tk8.3.1 added
  Internal headers for tk8.2.2 added 

- Makefile modified to generate shared library as default target (rather than
  the demo programs).  Also added appropriate command to library target to 
  create a generate link (ex: libtogl.so).

- Needed to expose more Togl internals.  Created auxilliary include file
  "toglinternals.h" to reflect the additional public access, and "toglinlines.h"
  to hold the implementations.  This later file is then appended to the end of 
  the "togl.c" file.


